SUMMARY:Uposatha (observance day)
DESCRIPTION:Computed from the tithi running at sunrise (panchang convention
 \, 06:00 IST approximation)\; regional calendars may shift it ±1 day. A l
 unar observance day (new moon\, full moon or a quarter moon)\; lay devotee
 s keep the Eight Precepts\, and many fast.
END:VEVENT
